# Shared calc.fdf template for the whole OER workflow. Left as non-polarized
# and with MD.VariableCell true on purpose: stb-oer's own config_extra.fdf
# unconditionally overrides BOTH (fixed cell, Spin polarized, DFTD3 -- see
# the README's Section 1.5) -- this template proves those overrides
# actually win over whatever the template itself says, the same
# "%include'd ahead of your own settings, first-occurrence-wins" mechanism
# every config_extra.fdf-based tool in this suite uses.
SystemLabel siesta
%include structure.fdf

PAO.BasisType split
PAO.BasisSize DZP
kgrid.MonkhorstPack [4 4 1]
Mesh.CutOff 200 Ry
XC.functional GGA
XC.authors PBE
Spin non-polarized

MD.TypeOfRun CG
MD.VariableCell true
MD.MaxForceTol 0.01 eV/Ang
MD.Steps 150
